Eligible substances include regulated, controlled, or illicit psychoactive compounds, including but not limited to: cannabis, alcohol, psilocybin, cocaine, and lysergic acid
diethylamide (LSD).

Dietary stimulants, specifically caffeine and nicotine, are explicitly excluded from this definition.